MapEditor_AttrDesc_Warp:
{Name}

Teleports the player the moment they step on it. A dialog lets you set the destination Map #, X, and Y. Commonly used for doors, cave entrances, and zone transitions.

Data stored: Map # · X · Y

MapEditor_AttrDesc_Item:
{Name}

Spawns a floor item that players can pick up. After collection it respawns after a configurable delay; 0 uses the server default (120 s).

Data stored: Item # · Value · Respawn Seconds

MapEditor_AttrDesc_KeyOpen:
{Name}

A trigger tile. Walking over it automatically unlocks the Key tile at the specified coordinates — no item required. The player receives no feedback; the linked door simply opens. Use it for secret passages and puzzle triggers.

Data stored: Key Tile X · Key Tile Y

MapEditor_AttrDesc_LayerRamp:
{Name}

The walkable connector between the Ground layer and the Fringe layer (the top of a bridge). Authored on the Fringe layer: mounting the ramp from its Ground-side direction climbs onto the bridge, and stepping off toward that side descends. Place one at each end of a Fringe surface so the bridge can be entered and left.

Data stored: Ground-side Direction

